 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "I left right after, too...\nFew minutes before midnight.": "",
  "Is there a security camera by the back door?": "",
  "Yup. Sounds like it's broken, though.": "",
  "So you were seen dragging Kume into the club...\nThen he was found in the morning with his eyes gouged out.": "",
  "So you were seen dragging Kume into the club...\nThen he was found with his eyes gouged out.": "",
  "I'd arrest you too if I was a cop.": "",
  "What do we have on the victim?": "",
  "I wanna know some more about the victim.": "",
  "Toshiro Kume, 34.\nRun-of-the-mill Kyorei grunt.": "",
  "Was Kume alone when you ran into him?": "",
  "Was Kume alone in Kamurocho when\nyou ran into him?": "",
  "Hard to believe he'd take\nthat kind of risk in hostile territory.": "",
  "Hard to believe he'd take that\nrisk in a hostile family's territory.": "",
  "It was him and one more. Probably another\nKyorei asshole. Don't know his name, though.": "",
  "Mm, it was him and one more.\nProbably another Kyorei asshole. Don't know his name.": "",
  "So there were two of them,\nand how many of you?": "",
  "So two Kyorei Clan members against...?": "",
  "I'd say there was probably five,\nincluding me.": "",
  "Including me, five from the Matsugane.": "",
  "Why didn't you guys take\nKume's friend in, too?": "",
  "Why didn't you guys pull Kume's friend\ninto Amour, too?": "",
  "We tried. Bastard ran like\nthe goddamn wind, though.": "",
  "He bolted before we had a chance.\nHeh... Scared out of his goddamn mind.": "",
  "Who's the detective in charge of the case?": "",
  "Kuroiwa, from organized crime.\nShintani-sensei's probably real familiar with him.": "",
  "Kuroiwa, from Kamurocho PD's Organized Crime Division.\nShintani-sensei's probably real familiar.": "",
  "I am. Moreso because he's one\nof those brutes with a badge.": "",
  "I am. He's not exactly known\nfor a light touch.": "",
  "Pretty sure the Kyorei murders are his case.": "",
  "Pretty sure he's in charge of\nall the Kyorei murders.": "",
  "I can't stand him.\nGuy doesn't give a rat's ass about yakuza.": "",
  "He doesn't give a shit about yakuza.\nI can't stand the guy.": "",
  "You have an alibi?\nWhat time do they think Kume died?": "",
  "You have any alibi to work with?\nWhat time do they think Kume died?": "",
  "Apparently between 2 and 3 in the morning.\nThe cops were drilling me real hard about where I was 'round then.": "",
  "Apparently between 2 and 3 in the morning.\nThe cops had a lot of questions, specifically about where I was then.": "",
  "And? Where were you?": "",
  "So where <font_kind=yakuza_italic>were</font_kind> you?": "",
  "At a sauna. A spot called Sauna Goten.\nSpent the night getting a steam.": "",
  "A sauna. Place in Kamurocho called Sauna Goten.\nSpent the night steaming.": "",
  "But there's no proof you were actually there,\nhuh? Otherwise you wouldn't be in here.": "",
  "But there's no proof you were actually there. Am I right?\nOtherwise you wouldn't be in here.": "",
  "Pretty much.\nSomeone shoulda seen something though.": "",
  "Got that right.\n<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Somebody</font_kind> should've seen me, though.": "",
  "I think I've heard enough for now.": "",
  "We'll get going then.": "",
  "Okay, good.": "",
  "Yagami. Head over to Sauna Goten for me.": "",
  "Yagami. Now that we're done,\ngo check out Sauna Goten.": "",
  "See if Hamura's alibi holds water.": "",
  "Hopefully, someone can verify\nHamura's alibi.": "",
  "If we can prove he was there,\nwe won't even have to go to trial.": "",
  "I'll give you a ring tomorrow\nfor the report. Later.": "",
  "Expect a call from me tomorrow.\nSee you later.": "",
  "(Sauna Goten... This is where Hamura says he was\non the night of the crime.)": "",
  "Excuse me, you work here?": "",
  "Excuse me, do you work here?": "",
  "Yeah, come on in, friend.": "",
  "Oh, welcome. Go on in.": "",
  "Actually, I'm not a customer.\nMind if I ask you a few questions?": "",
  "Actually, I'd like to ask you\na few questions...": "",
  "Sure, whaddya need?": "",
  "Mm? What's up?": "",
  "I'm here about a murder.\nThe yakuza who had his eyes gouged out.": "",
  "Oh. A detective came by\nfor the same thing.": "",
  "Wanted to know if their suspect\nwas with us the night of the incident.": "",
  "And you are...?\nA reporter?": "",
  "And you are...? A reporter?": "",
  "Something like that, yeah.": "",
  "Something like that, yeah. Anyway...": "",
  "And this is Hamura, captain of the Matsugane Family.\nDid he come in on the night of the crime?": "",
  "This is Hamura, captain of the Matsugane Family.\nOn the night of the crime, did he drop by this sauna?": "",
  "I'll tell you the same thing I told the cops.": "",
  "The cops were asking me that too.\nI'll tell you what I told them.": "",
  "I make it a point not to remember\nanyone specific, you know?": "",
  "I don't remember who comes and goes\non <font_kind=yakuza_italic>any</font_kind> given night.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I see. If this old man had remembered Hamura's face,\nthen he would have had an alibi.)</color>": "",
  "You get a lot of customers in and out, huh?": "",
  "Up to the last train, at least.\nFrom there it's only \"in\" 'til morning.": "",
  "Up to the last train, at least.\nFrom there on, it's only \"in\" 'til morning.": "",
  "You know how it is. People drop in,\nwait for the trains to start up again.": "",
  "Folks drop in for a bath,\nstay until the trains start up again.": "",
  "Same as any other night.": "",
  "Same as always.": "",
  "Interesting... So everyone who comes in\nstays 'til morning, huh?": "",
  "I see, so... everyone who comes\nin stays 'til morning, huh?": "",
  "Then as long as I can prove Hamura\nwas here... we'll have our alibi.": "",
  "In that case... as long as I can prove Hamura\nwas here, we'll have our alibi.": "",
  "Oh yeah, the cops mentioned\nsomething kinda similar.": "",
  "Right, right. The cops said somethin'\nalong those lines.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If I can prove that Hamura was here on the night\nof the crime, then that will solve everything.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(But there supposedly wasn't any promising evidence\nto point to an alibi.)</color>": "",
  "You guys don't have a security camera?\nSomething we could check, see who was here.": "",
  "You guys don't have a security camera?\nSomething we could check?": "",
  "We do, but it deletes all its footage\nevery three days. Privacy and all.": "",
  "We do, but it automatically deletes all its footage\nevery three days, for privacy.": "",
  "It was already long gone\nby the time the cops came 'round.": "",
  "It was already long gone when\nthe cops came 'round.": "",
  "Got it, thanks.\nSorry to bother you.": "",
  "That's a shame... Well, thanks.\nSorry to bother you.": "",
  "(Maybe I should try asking\nsome other people around here.)": "",
  "(So much for that. Guess I should\nhead home for tonight.) ": "",
  "I'm looking for info on a yakuza who stopped by\nSauna Goten on the night of December 3rd.": "",
  "On the night of December 3rd, I heard a yakuza\nstopped by Sauna Goten.": "",
  "Did you see anything?": "",
  "This is the guy.\nName's Hamura.": "",
  "Here. The guy's named Hamura.": "",
  "Can't say I know him.\nThere's tons of yakuza around here.": "",
  "Though now that you mention it... I remember something\nabout a host getting smacked in the face that night.": "",
  "Though... A yakuza around here on the 3rd, huh?\nI did hear a host got smacked down that night.": "",
  "By a yakuza?": "",
  "Yup. Don't think he got hurt too bad, though.\nPretty sure it happened right around midnight.": "",
  "All this on the night of the incident...": "",
  "So that night, there was an assault\non a host...?": "",
  "But when I went to check things out, the yakuza was\nlong gone. Host was just standing there shouting.": "",
  "But when I went to check things out, the yakuza\nwas long gone. Host was just standing there shouting.": "",
  "That help at all?": "",
  "So? That help? It's all I've got.": "",
  "Hm. Uh, any idea who the host was?": "",
  "Hm. Any idea who the host was?": "",
  "Nah. I mean, they all kind of have\nthat pretty boy look.": "",
  "No idea. I mean, all those hosts have that\nsame kind of pretty boy look.": "",
  "Doubt I'd be able to recognize him\nif he was standing right in front of me.": "",
  "Wouldn't know him even if he was\nstanding in front of me.": "",
  "Does anyone else know about this?": "",
  "I dunno.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess this isn't much of a lead, then.)</color>": "",
  "Thanks for your help.": "",
  "Thanks. I appreciate it.": "",
  "You again?\nI already told you what I know.": "",
  "What, you again?\nI already told you what I know.": "",
  "Some host got hit by a yakuza night of the 3rd. You wanna\nknow more, you're gonna have to find someone else.": "",
  "Some host got hit by a yakuza night of the 3rd.\nBut that's all I've got.": "",
  "Hey, you have a sec? I'm looking for info on a yakuza\nwho went to Sauna Goten on the night of December 3rd.": "",
  "Hey, you have a sec? I'm looking for info on a yakuza.\nHe went to Sauna Goten on the night of December 3rd.": "",
  "Pfff, you seriously expect me to remember\nsomething from that long ago?": "",
  "What, you kidding? How should I remember something\nfrom that long ago?": "",
  "I'm trying to work here!\nGet lost!": "",
  "I'm trying to work here! Get lost!": "",
  "Hey, you're out here\npretty often, right?": "",
  "Did you see a yakuza head into\nSauna Goten the night of December 3rd?": "",
  "On the night of December 3rd, did you see a yakuza\nhead into Sauna Goten?": "",
  "Um, why would I know that?\nYou're crazy, mister.": "",
  "Hmmm, well... I dunno! Hahah!\nYou're funny, Mister.": "",
  "Nobody pays attention to me,\nso I'm not gonna pay attention to them.": "",
  "You're back?\nSorry, I don't have much more to say.": "",
  "You're back? Sorry, don't have\nmuch more to say.": "",
  "I mean, look at me. When you get this old,\nyou're gonna have trouble remembering faces, too.": "",
  "You're still here?\nI thought you'd have left hours ago.": "",
  "Whoa, Kaito-san?\nI thought you'd left hours ago.": "",
  "I was gonna, but I realized all I'd do at home\nis pass out. Did go for a drink, though.": "",
  "Figured if I went home, I'd just crash.\nDid go out for a drink, though.": "",
  "And now you're having another?\nYou know that bottle's mine?": "",
  "And you're still drinking back here?\nWith my booze?": "",
  "Heh. Well?\nGenda-sensei give you any work?": "",
  "Heh heh... Well? Pick up any jobs?": "",
  "Yep, probably thanks to the dorayaki.": "",
  "I guess the dorayaki really did help.": "",
  "He wants me to scrounge up some\nevidence. For a murder trial.": "",
  "They've got me gathering evidence.\nFor a murder trial.": "",
  "You got this from Genda?": "",
  "You got this from <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Genda</font_kind>?": "",
  "I thought he was all about civil suits now.\nCriminals don't pay the bills, right?": "",
  "Ain't he all about the civil suits now?\nSaid there's no money in criminal cases.": "",
  "Well, this one comes straight from Matsugane-san.\nTurns out Hamura went and got himself arrested.": "",
  "For one of those Kyorei Clan murders.": "",
  "For one of those Kyorei murders.": "",
  "You mean that eye gouging shit?": "",
  "Uh... The ones with the gouged eyes?": "",
  "Mhm. Just dropped by the jail to see him.\nHe claims he's innocent, though.": "",
  "Yeah. Just dropped by the jail to see him.\nHe claims he's innocent, though.": "",
  "Huh. Crazy.": "",
  "Huh. That so?": "",
  "Not interested?": "",
  "Can't say I blame you after what Hamura did.\nBooting you from the family was a low blow.": "",
  "If you want, I'll handle it solo.": "",
  "I can go it alone if you want.": "",
  "Look, don't worry 'bout it.\nI'm the one who fucked up, not him.": "",
  "Don't worry 'bout it. He didn't just \"kick me out.\"\nI know I fucked up.": "",
  "Either way, we've got the case.\nCount me in.": "",
  "Either way, we've got the case.\nI'll help out.": "",
  "Heh, good.": "",
  "(Well, I should get some rest.)": "",
  "What's up, Shintani?": "",
  "Morning, sunshine.\nI'm on Nakamichi Street.": "",
  "It's Shintani. I'm on Nakamichi Street.": "",
  "Yeah, and?": "",
  "Huh. Okay?": "",
  "You know Mijore?\nLittle cafe, killer coffee? C'mere.": "",
  "You know Mijore, the little café?\nI'll wait for you there.": "",
  "Another impromptu meeting?": "",
  "Man, another surprise meeting,\nShintani-sensei?": "",
  "Don't whine.\nI thought you liked keeping busy.": "",
  "Hey, don't complain.\nI thought you liked keeping busy.": "",
  "Hey, over here.\nTake a seat.": "",
  "Hey, over here.\nPull up a chair.": "",
  "...Right. Anyway,\nI asked around near Sauna Goten.": "",
  "...Anyway, I asked around\nnear Sauna Goten.": "",
  "Couldn't get anyone to\nback up Hamura's alibi, though.": "",
  "Couldn't get anyone to back up\nHamura's alibi, though.": "",
  "All right. Good work.": "",
  "So? What'd you call me out here for?": "",
  "...So? What'd you call me out here for?": "",
  "Something came up.\nTake a look at this.": "",
  "I got some new info.\nHere, look at this.": "",
  "Cops released it to the media.\nIt's the camera footage from Amour.": "",
  "Hamura and Kume're both in here,\nclear as day.": "",
  "Damn. Didn't realize the cops had their\nhands on this. This could be pretty bad.": "",
  "Rock-solid evidence of Hamura and Kume's fight...\nDidn't realize the cops had their hands on this.": "",
  "Ready? I'm gonna play it.": "",
  "You ready? I'm gonna play it.": "",
  "Explains why Kume's buddy there\nis running for his life.": "",
  "So, the guy running away from the fight...\nThat's Kume's buddy, huh?": "",
  "Yup. Got a name, too.\nAkira Murase. Another Kyorei thug.": "",
  "Yup. Got a name, too. Akira Murase.\nAnother Kyorei thug like Kume.": "",
  "Word is, he hasn't left Kamurocho\nafter getting interrogated by the cops.": "",
  "The cops already got through questioning him,\nbut he's apparently still in Kamurocho.": "",
  "By the look of things,\nthere must be a Kyorei hideout nearby.": "",
  "Meaning, there's a Kyorei\nhideout somewhere in town.": "",
  "Kume's the poor bastard\ngetting dragged into the club.": "",
  "The unlucky bastard getting dragged into the club?\nThat's Kume.": "",
  "Crazy how clear it all is.\nHamura can't just talk his way out of this.": "",
  "Yup, and there's more.\nTake a look at this.": "",
  "Yup, and there's more. One hour later,\nthings get really interesting.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Did something else happen?\nWhat else could the camera have caught?)</color>": "",
  "One hour later. Everyone leaves. Except...\nfor Hamura and Kume. Even the owner hightails it. ": "",
  "One hour later. Hamura and Kume stay.\nEveryone else in Amour leaves. Even the owner.": "",
  "Wait, why would they stick around?": "",
  "Hamura and Kume were the only ones in there?\nWhy would they stick around...?": "",
  "Who knows? Our pal Hamura\nnever mentioned this part.": "",
  "Now, this happened around 10 PM.": "",
  "Meaning there was another four hours\nbefore Kume's suspected time of death.": "",
  "Meaning there was another four hours before\nKume's suspected time of death.": "",
  "The question is, what were the two\nof them doing all that time?": "",
  "The question is, what were Hamura and Kume\ndoing all that time?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So, there's no doubt that Hamura was\nalone with Kume right before he died.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What did Hamura say he did\nwith Kume, again?)</color>": "",
  "Hamura said he threw Kume\nout of the club around midnight.": "",
  "Hamura said he threw Kume out of the club\nsometime around midnight.": "",
  "After that, he left the club\nhimself and went to the sauna.": "",
  "After that, he left the club himself\nand went to the sauna.": "",
  "Right. But I wanna hear how it all\nwent down from a different angle.": "",
  "Right. But I think we need to hear the story\nfrom someone other than Hamura.": "",
  "That's where you come in, Yagami.\nYou gotta talk to the guy in charge of Amour.": "",
  "Which brings me to you. Yagami, you go talk to\nthe guy who runs Amour.": "",
  "Back up a second.": "",
  "You're the lawyer here, I get that. You decide\nwhat kinda investigation we need for the trial.": "",
  "You're the lawyer here. You decide what kind of\ninvestigation we need for the trial.": "",
  "But don't tell me how to do my job.": "",
  "Yeah, but...\nAren't you gonna talk to him either way?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Excuse me, do you work here?": "ขอโทษนะครับ คุณทำงานที่นี่ใช่ไหมครับ?",
  "I dunno.": "ฉันก็ไม่รู้เหมือนกัน",
  "Thanks for your help.": "ขอบคุณที่ช่วยนะ",
  "Thanks. I appreciate it.": "ขอบคุณ ซึ้งใจจริงๆ",
  "Huh. That so?": "หืม งั้นเหรอ?",
  "Yeah, and?": "ใช่ แล้วไง?"
 }
}
